\tag{fdip}
\title{Two loop transports and a quaternion block}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The [cochain operator](fdip-00SR) keeps the exterior
cell directions separate from the coefficient action.
On a torus with one vertex, each transport acts on a single
Hurwitz coefficient. The even and odd cell degrees each
carry two copies of the coefficient fiber.}

\transclude{fdip-00Z9}
